{"about_the_game":"<strong>Welcome to &quot;W.I.M.S. - Where is my ship?!&quot;</strong><br><br>in this first person precision platformer you will play as a small intruder trying to escape a humans home.<br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br>You and your crew entered a humans home through a window to find food to survive. While trying to get some food the Human thought there were bugs on the food and through it into the trash. You and your friends fell down. Your crew tried to build a way to the top to escape the humans home with your ship.<br><br>After the parkour is build, your crew ist trying to escape. You failed your last jump and fell down again. Are you able to jump back to the top and find your ship?<br><br>This Game is inspired by only up, getting over it and jump king. <br><br>Find Burger at the end of each Level to unlock future Level.<br><br>Find Upgrades, like double jump or dash to change the way to play.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><br>Play in multiple ways.<br><br><strong>Standard</strong><br><br>In this mode you are able to control your jumps while in the air to adjust your landing. <br><br><strong>Challenge</strong><br><br>In this mode you are cannot control your jumps while in the air. <br><br><strong>Wheel</strong><br><br>In this mode you are cannot control your jumps while in the air. <br><br>Use the mouse wheel to adjust the jump strength you want to use.<br><br><strong>Standard-Air-Charge</strong><br><br>In this mode you are able to control your jumps while in the air to adjust your landing and you are able to strengthen your next jump while in the air. But you are only be able to jump while on the ground.<br><br><strong>Challenge-Air-Charge</strong><br><br>In this mode you are cannot control your jumps while in the air and you are able to strengthen your next jump while in the air. But you are only be able to jump while on the ground.<br><br>There will be a Multiplayer Update in a future Version of the game. Stay tuned for that.<br><br